      ],
      "title": "ecmp: use a simpler way to read a time field",
      "message": "ecmp: use a simpler way to read a time field\n\nFix two more places where we can remove the manual parsing of a time field\nand let the epan routines do the work for us.\n",
      "author_name": "Martin Kaiser",
      "author_email": "wireshark@kaiser.cx",
      "authored_date": "2020-09-15T13:41:11.000+02:00",
      "committer_name": "Martin Kaiser",
